" data-hook="reviewTitle" lang="en-CA">Lovely shelf, wonky instructions and missing screw</h4><div data-hook="review-by-line" class="a-row a-spacing-none"><span data-hook="review-date" class="a-size-small a-color-tertiary">Reviewed in Canada on April 29, 2024</span></div><div data-hook="product-variation-attributes" class="a-row a-spacing-mini"><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">Size: 140cm<i class="a-icon a-icon-text-separator" role="presentation"></i></span><span data-hook="format-strip-linkless" class="a-size-small a-color-secondary">Colour Name: Walnut</span></div><div data-hook="reviewTextContainer" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-text-container_325WM"><div data-hook="reviewText" class="a-cardui-deck _Y3Itd_card-deck_37S9P _Y3Itd_mobile_lV1ss" data-a-remove-top-gutter="true" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter="true" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-14"><div class="a-teaser-describedby-collapsed a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-14-teaser-describedby-collapsed">Brief content visible, double tap to read full content.</div><div class="a-teaser-describedby-expanded a-hidden" id="a-cardui-deck-autoname-14-teaser-describedby-expanded">Full content visible, double tap to read brief content.</div><div data-csa-c-slot-id="customer_review-R23BIES590LOFQ_3_review_text" data-csa-c-type="element" class="a-cardui _Y3Itd_peek-expand_3G9Ub" data-a-card-type="peekExpand" name="a-cardui-deck-autoname-14-card0" data-csa-c-id="3ooodh-99iduo-pz6m4t-cgmbku"><div class="a-cardui-body _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-reactive-container a-reactive-container-transition"><div><div class="a-cardui-content a-cardui-uninitialized" data-a-max-height="100" style="max-height:100px"><div class="_Y3Itd_relative_1SChh"><div data-hook="reviewRichContentContainer" lang="en-CA" class="_Y3Itd_contain-rich-content_2IORW"><p><span>It was tricky to put together because the instructions graphics were too busy to be able to see exactly what went where. It would have been great to have a paper template for the back hole placement (so masking tape to mark out is the next best option).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>We were missing a screw for the handle, and there’s no option to connect with the seller directly to request a missing part. Amazon offered me $5 via a balance to my account, but this somewhat doesn’t make up for me now needing to make a trip to a hardware store to find a singular screw (or, a new handle entirely if I can’t find the correct screw - not the end of the world, the handle is cheap).</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>Having said that, the shelf itself is lovely and sturdy. The centre fold-down door is an odd colour choice and the handle isn’t aesthetically pleasing.</span></p><p><span></span></p><p><span>In other words, mostly good but some improvements to be made.</span></p></div></div></div></div><div class="a-reactive-container-gradient"></div></div></div><div data-hook="reviewExpandButtonContainer" class="a-cardui-footer _Y3Itd_no-padding_1A9ha"><div class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer _Y3Itd_read-more-less_2uDYd" data-csa-c-type="widget" data-csa-interaction-events="click" data-csa-c-id="wj72s8-suocxm-tlpgsn-cejuae"><a href="javascript:void(0)" class="a-cardui-expand-control-footer-button" role="button"><span class="a-expander-icon"><i class="a-css-icon a-css-icon-draw a-css-icon-expand"></i></span><span class="a-see-more a-color-link"><span class="a-see-more-text" style="">Read more</span><span class="a-see-less-text" style="display:none">Read less</span></span></a></div></div></div></div><div data-hook="translationSpinner" class="_Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner-container_ypxf2" style="display: none !important;"><div class="a-spinner-wrapper _Y3Itd_single-review-translation-spinner_1tBUJ"><span class="a-spinner a-spinner-medium"></span></div></div></div><div class="a-row"><div class="a-row a-spacing-top-small"><div class="a-row _Y3Itd_single-review-vote-action-bar_10AyR"><div da